# Voice Assistant

A Python-based voice assistant that listens to voice commands and responds using text-to-speech.

## Features

* Voice input using microphone
* Greeting response
* Current date and time
* Google web search
* Error handling
* Text-to-speech responses

## Technologies

Python, SpeechRecognition, PyAudio, pyttsx3, datetime, webbrowser







# BMI Calculator

A Python program that calculates Body Mass Index (BMI) using the user's height and weight and displays the corresponding health category.

## Features

* Accepts height and weight
* Calculates BMI
* Displays BMI category
* Input validation

## Technologies

Python



# Password Generator

A Python-based application that generates random passwords based on the user's selected length and character types.

## Features

* Custom password length
* Uppercase and lowercase letters
* Numbers and symbols
* Input validation
* Generate multiple passwords

## Technologies

Python, random, string















